        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("It was with great relief that they finally spotted the Silent Forest on the evening of their second day. They quickly made camp in the hope of getting some much needed rest. However, as dawn approached, a thick fog rolled in and all the natural sounds of the forest died away — leaving everything deathly quiet."),
