      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_killer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Now we’re going to have some answers out of you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You might as well go ahead and kill me, I’m not telling you anything."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Very well then..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Some time later..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("So you elves have set up an enclave here have you. Why is that?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We made an agreement with the humans some time ago. They were planning a major assault on you war-mongers, and the humans pledged that if we assisted them they would give us a large chunk of your territory once the battle was over."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Why would you elves want still more territory? You already have the undisputed rule of the whole elvish forest."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Yes, but our prince has been banished from those lands for collaborating with humans. He now seeks to carve out an empire for himself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hmmm, interesting. So you set up a base here to launch your attacks on us. Is that right?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Yes, that is correct."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Well folks, it looks like we have our work cut out for us. We must destroy this enclave."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_15",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_18",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Ahhhhh!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_21",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Good work, men, we’ve done it! Now we don’t have to worry about these elves attacking us. Let’s get some rest and continue our journey."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
